  <div class="container-full-width container--padding" >
    <div class="content-container container-sm">
      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101012/RKPartizanAdmiralBet-FCPorto/" target="_blank" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">Highlight Match: RK Partizan AdmiralBet (SRB) vs FC Porto (POR) 33:33 (14:16)</a></h3><p>H2H: 2-1-1<br>Top scorers: Nikola Crnoglavac 8/10 (RK Partizan AdmiralBet); Pedro Oliveira 6/7 (FC Porto)</p><p>Despite both teams being eliminated, Partizan and Porto knew the importance of Wednesday’s game: Two points to take into the EHF European League for the winner. Right from the off, Porto seemed quicker to settle into their rhythm. As Sebastian Abrahamsson pulled off a couple of important saves and Ricardo Brandão’s hands did not shake when it came to scoring, the Portuguese side took an early three-goal advantage. The visitors remained on top until the break, despite Yoav Lumbroso and Tobias Wagner doing their best to keep their side in the race. What Porto did not manage to do before the break, they did after it. As Abrahamsson saved three shots in a row, the Portuguese side scored as many straight goals and soon broke away to sit seven ahead. That was not the end of Belgrade’s hopes though: In a desperate run of honour, Nikola Crnoglavac scored three in a row. As a result, the visitors came back within one, and even offered themselves the opportunity to draw on the last offence. Lazar Andjelkovic did not miss the opportunity, offering his club its first point in the competition.</p><p><span class="umb-embed-holder" data-embed-constrain="true" data-embed-height="393" data-embed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8omMU_MeXG0" data-embed-width="700"><iframe width="699" height="393" class="_iub_cs_activate" data-iub-purposes="3" data-suppressedsrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/8omMU_MeXG0?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="RK Partizan AdmiralBet vs FC Porto | Highlights | EHF Champions League Men 2026/27"></iframe></span></p>
        </div>


<div class="consent-info js-consent-info" data-purposes="3">
    <div class="consent-info-content">
        <h2>This content is blocked</h2>
        <p>You said no to using cookies or similar tools that help improve your experience. To see this content, you would need to update your <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="iubenda-cs-preferences-link">Privacy Preferences</a>.</p>
