</div>      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Aljo&#x161;a Damjanovi&#x107;">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/vdwlaj1u/partizan_porto-211026-maja-nastic-47.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/vdwlaj1u/partizan_porto-211026-maja-nastic-47.jpg"
                         alt="Partizan Porto 211026 Maja Nastic 47">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We wanted to win and we tried to put our best show today, but that wasn&#39;t enough. Porto plays so good in offence, and our defence wasn&#39;t on the good level today. But after around 45th minute, we started to run. We made some mistakes even then, but we started to run, to play and to give everything, and today that was enough for the draw.             </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Aljo&#x161;a Damjanovi&#x107;</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Centre back, RK Partizan AdmiralBet</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Jo&#xE3;o Gomes">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/mf3l5hlm/partizan_porto-211026-maja-nastic-46.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/mf3l5hlm/partizan_porto-211026-maja-nastic-46.jpg"
                         alt="Partizan Porto 211026 Maja Nastic 46">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We started really good. I think some problems on the defence, on the defensive side, but on the offence we were really good. At the end, I think we had some misses, and then we gave the opportunities to Partizan to get back in the game. So, I think it was a well-disputed game.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Jo&#xE3;o Gomes</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Right back, FC Porto</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

