  <div class="container-full-width container--padding" >
    <div class="content-container container-sm">
      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <p>GROUP B</p><h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101017/HBCNantes-HCVardar1961/" target="_blank" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">HBC Nantes (FRA) vs HC Vardar 1961 (MKD) 27:33 (13:16)</a></h3><p>H2H: 2-0-2<br>Top scorers: Ihor Turchenko 4/6, Luka Peric 4/6 (Nantes); Leon Ljevar 7/9 (HC Vardar 1961)</p><p>The first half of Wednesday’s confrontation was all about goalkeepers. Vardar’s Miłosz Wałach first put himself into the spotlight, helping the visitors take a four-goal lead with six saves within the opening quarter. “Le H” used the turning point of a missed fast-break chance for Vardar to steal the momentum, thanks to Christoffer Bonde’s saves, but the French side never managed to level the game after the first minutes. Worse, they could not prevent Vardar breaking away again and with Uroš Mitrović driving with four goals in the first half, the visitors finished ahead by three at the break. Vardar kept the momentum in the second half, as Wałach was still on fire between the posts. But this time, his teammates were able to knock Nantes on the head, with Jaka Malus and Leon Ljevar giving the North Macedonian side an eight-goal advantage six minutes before the siren. Junior Matiaba-Tuzolana pulled the advantage across the 10-goal mark at the 56th minute, securing Vardar’s first win of the season.</p><p><span class="umb-embed-holder" data-embed-constrain="true" data-embed-height="393" data-embed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AVUKNechDpg" data-embed-width="700"><iframe width="699" height="393" class="_iub_cs_activate" data-iub-purposes="3" data-suppressedsrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/AVUKNechDpg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="HBC Nantes vs HC Vardar 1961 | Highlights | EHF Champions League Men 2026/27"></iframe></span></p>
        </div>


<div class="consent-info js-consent-info" data-purposes="3">
    <div class="consent-info-content">
