<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Ivan Cupic">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/kzcn0kgz/20262110_hbcnantes_vardar_team.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/kzcn0kgz/20262110_hbcnantes_vardar_team.jpg"
                         alt="20262110 Hbcnantes Vardar Team">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
It’s always hard to play in Nantes. We had four tough matches we lost in the last minutes, with one or two-goal difference. We were waiting for one perfect match and two points we could celebrate. It was important to show we are better than in the previous matches.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Ivan Cupic</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach, HC Vardar 1961</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Gregory Cojean">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/0dfh1op3/202600909_hbcnantes_plock_cojean.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/0dfh1op3/202600909_hbcnantes_plock_cojean.jpg"
                         alt="202600909 Hbcnantes Plock Cojean">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
This is the worst night I&#39;ve experienced in five years, if not longer. We&#39;ve been struggling in our one-on-one situations against the goalkeeper for several games now. We&#39;re creating chances, but we&#39;re not managing to score. We were punished for it, we lost confidence and it was really tough tonight. Defensively, things weren&#39;t much better. We&#39;re far too inconsistent             </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Gregory Cojean</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach, HBC Nantes</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

