  <div class="container-full-width container--padding" >
    <div class="content-container container-sm">
      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <p>GROUP C</p><h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101032/HCZagreb-ParisSaintGermain/" target="_blank" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">HC Zagreb (CRO) vs Paris Saint-Germain (FRA) 29:28 (13:17)</a></h3><p>H2H: 3-0-14<br>Top scorers: Ihar Bialiauski 8/10 (HC Zagreb); Ferran Solé 10/11 (Paris Saint-Germain)</p><p>Despite being eliminated from the main round race, Zagreb had no intention of playing a friendly game against Paris on Wednesday night. With Giorgi Tskhovrebadze scoring three in the first 10 minutes, the hosts kept up with Paris’ tempo early on. But as Ferran Solé did not miss anything and passed Zagreb’s keepers six times in the first half alone, the French side slowly but surely created a clear upper hand as the half-time break approached. The second half was completely different, as Zagreb took the momentum right from the start. With Sandro Meštric working up to nine saves and Ihar Bialiauski on scoring duties, the hosts came back little by little. Filip Glavaš levelled the score with five minutes to play, though Zagreb’s defence held tight. Recovering a couple of Paris’ turnovers, the Croatian side moved ahead for the first time in the second half within the last five minutes, before PSG wasted their last opportunity to equalise in the final seconds. Thanks to this win, Zagreb secured third spot in the group.</p><p><span class="umb-embed-holder" data-embed-constrain="true" data-embed-height="393" data-embed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xqpX-BYJXfk" data-embed-width="700"><iframe width="699" height="393" class="_iub_cs_activate" data-iub-purposes="3" data-suppressedsrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/xqpX-BYJXfk?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="HC Zagreb vs Paris Saint-Germain | Highlights | EHF Champions League Men 2026/27"></iframe></span></p>
        </div>


<div class="consent-info js-consent-info" data-purposes="3">
    <div class="consent-info-content">
        <h2>This content is blocked</h2>
        <p>You said no to using cookies or similar tools that help improve your experience. To see this content, you would need to update your <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="iubenda-cs-preferences-link">Privacy Preferences</a>.</p>
