  </div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Mateo Mara&#x161;">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/qr2ggu00/261021_pxl_zagre-psg001.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/qr2ggu00/261021_pxl_zagre-psg001.jpg"
                         alt="261021 PXL Zagre PSG001">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
I feel like we did control the game in the opening half, but in the second half their 5-1 defence caused us a lot of trouble and helped them crawl back into it, eventually turning the game around completely. A well-deserved win for them, especially after some tough, narrow defeats they have already suffered this season.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Mateo Mara&#x161;</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Right back, Paris Saint-Germain</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Hrvoje Horvat">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/4aalxlk3/261021_pxl_zagre-psg055.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/4aalxlk3/261021_pxl_zagre-psg055.jpg"
                         alt="261021 PXL Zagre PSG055 (1)">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
Finally, a well-deserved win for us after some really tough, close losses already this season. We remained calm after the first half, in which we were four goals behind, and in the second half everything went our way —&#160;defence, offence, even the fans followed, and after that it felt like there was nothing stopping us anymore.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Hrvoje Horvat</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach, HC Zagreb</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

