  <div class="container-full-width container--padding" >
    <div class="content-container container-sm">
      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101029/AalborgHåndbold-RKCeljePivovarnaLaško/" target="_blank" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">Aalborg Håndbold (DEN) vs RK Celje Pivovarna Laško (SLO) 34:30 (17:13)</a></h3><p>H2H: 8-0-1<br>Top scorers: Thomas Arnoldsen 6/8 (Aalborg Håndbold); Tadej Mazej 5/5, Aljuš Anžic 5/10, Mattis Heiss 5/5 (RK Celje Pivovarna Laško)</p><p>Aalborg coach Simon Dahl had decided to use the game against Celje to offer playing time to lesser-used players, and the first half validated his decision. With Norwegian right back Patrick Anderson a key force in attack, the Danish side broke away early — already ahead by seven after 19 minutes. The Slovenian side stabilised their deficit to four goals before the break, thanks to Gal Gaberšek making a couple of saves. Aalborg remained in control in the second half, unable to increase their advantage further than six goals, but not letting their opponents come too close either. Juri Knorr made an impression coming on the court, scoring three within 10 minutes after the break — enough for Aalborg to secure the victory, which was their fourth across the first five games of their European season.</p><p><span class="umb-embed-holder" data-embed-constrain="true" data-embed-height="393" data-embed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZhKP7m4LQP8" data-embed-width="700"><iframe width="699" height="393" class="_iub_cs_activate" data-iub-purposes="3" data-suppressedsrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZhKP7m4LQP8?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="Aalborg Håndbold vs RK Celje Pivovarna Laško | Highlights | EHF Champions League Men 2026/27"></iframe></span></p>
        </div>


<div class="consent-info js-consent-info" data-purposes="3">
    <div class="consent-info-content">
