<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Vetle R&#xF8;nningen">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/4zah3o4d/211026aalborg-celje-ronningen-144.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/4zah3o4d/211026aalborg-celje-ronningen-144.jpg"
                         alt="211026Aalborg Celje Ronningen 144">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We got off to a great start with a great first half. Then we struggled a bit to close the match in the second half. Of course, in a match that didn&#39;t make or break us, we put up a great fight and showed a lot of great things.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Vetle R&#xF8;nningen</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Line player, Aalborg H&#xE5;ndbold</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Tadej Mazej">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/zeujomim/10_21_2026_aalbrog-rk-celje_71.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/zeujomim/10_21_2026_aalbrog-rk-celje_71.jpg"
                         alt="10 21 2026 Aalbrog RK Celje 71">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We stuck to what we agreed on in the locker room before the match — to fight from the first minute to the last. I&#39;m sure that 16 turnovers were significantly too many for a match like this. If we had, for example, cut that number in half, I think that in the end it might have turned out differently. As for the second half, I think we played on equal terms with them. That&#39;s what we just need to keep working on.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Tadej Mazej</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Left wing, RK Celje Pivovarna La&#x161;ko</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

