  <div class="container-full-width container--padding" >
    <div class="content-container container-sm">
      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <p>GROUP E</p><h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101059/DinamoBucuresti-SAHAarhus/" target="_blank" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">Dinamo Bucuresti (ROU) vs SAH - Aarhus (DEN) 37:23 (16:12)</a></h3><p>H2H: 1-1-0<br>Top scorers: Victor Iturizza 5/5 (Dinamo Bucuresti); Andreas Søgaard Rasmussen 4/4, Jeppe Månsson Cieslak 4/6 (SAH - Aarhus)</p><p>Was it the pressure to give themselves the chance of grabbing a ticket to the main round? No matter the reason, Aarhus did not have the best start to Wednesday’s game. Struggling offensively and reluctant to use their seven-against-six tactics in the first half, the Danish side were clearly lacking some offensive strength. Dinamo, on the other hand, were quick to find solutions, with Victor Iturizza and Haniel Langaro in the spotlight. As the two scored three goals in the first 21 minutes, the hosts took the maximum advantage of four goals in the first period — a lead they retained at the break. When Dinamo returned to court, they made the most of their opponents’ errors to increase their lead to eight seven minutes after the restart. That was the end of it for the Aarhus, who were never able to come back. On the other hand, Dinamo coach Paulo Perreira used the opportunity to open his bench and rotate most of his players on the court, with only one field player not scoring as their team enjoyed their first win of the season — and their biggest ever in the EHF Champions League.</p><p><span class="umb-embed-holder" data-embed-constrain="true" data-embed-height="393" data-embed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=byS9YUe2I2s" data-embed-width="700"><iframe width="699" height="393" class="_iub_cs_activate" data-iub-purposes="3" data-suppressedsrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/byS9YUe2I2s?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="Dinamo Bucuresti vs SAH - Aarhus | Highlights | EHF Champions League Men 2026/27"></iframe></span></p>
        </div>


<div class="consent-info js-consent-info" data-purposes="3">
    <div class="consent-info-content">
        <h2>This content is blocked</h2>
        <p>You said no to using cookies or similar tools that help improve your experience. To see this content, you would need to update your <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="iubenda-cs-preferences-link">Privacy Preferences</a>.</p>
