  </div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Ionu&#x21B; Iancu">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/nggh355m/20261021_dinamo_vs_aarhaus_b1_17.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/nggh355m/20261021_dinamo_vs_aarhaus_b1_17.jpg"
                         alt="20261021 DINAMO VS AARHAUS B1 17">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
A very good match played by us. I think this is the real Dinamo team, and I’m delighted that we managed to achieve this huge victory. We kept six players back for the start of the game. I’m very happy, and I’m glad the team has finally shown its true quality. We won by an incredible margin, and I’m really pleased with the way we played.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Ionu&#x21B; Iancu</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Goalkeeper, Dinamo-Bucuresti</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Emil L&#xE6;rke">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/oyufvnzl/20261021_dinamo_vs_aarhaus_b2_12.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/oyufvnzl/20261021_dinamo_vs_aarhaus_b2_12.jpg"
                         alt="20261021 DINAMO VS AARHAUS B2 12 (1)">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
They were in good shape today and we are not. They deserved to win. They start the game very good. They exploded our defence a lot. It was pretty tough for us to fight with them. It was not good enough effort for us today.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Emil L&#xE6;rke</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Left back, SAH - Aarhus</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

