  <div class="container-full-width container--padding" >
    <div class="content-container container-sm">
      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <p>GROUP F</p><h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101070/HCKriensLuzern-IndustriaKielce/" target="_blank" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">HC Kriens-Luzern (SUI) vs Industria Kielce (POL) 30:32 (17:19)</a></h3><p>H2H: 0-0-2<br>Top scorers: Marin Šipić 8/10 (HC Kriens-Luzern); Théo Monar 8/8 (Industria Kielce)</p><p>Kielce’s players knew well that they could book their main round ticket by winning in Switzerland — and their French players seemed highly motivated by this prospect, judging from their first-half performances. Théo Monar and Julien Bos scored a combined 11 goals before the break. But the Polish team were never able to take an advantage bigger than four goals, as their hosts opened strong and kept it tight. As Marin Šipić and Jerome Müller spearheaded the attack, Kriens-Luzern had everything open at half-time. The second period was a long neck-to-neck battle, with neither team able to take an advantage bigger than two goals. Despite Müller receiving a red card at minute 39, Kriens-Luzern kept up with the opponents’ rhythm throughout. Things came down to the last three minutes. Piotr Jarosiewicz scored two before Aleks Vlah netted the game winner, while the Swiss team failed to convert their last two offences and buried their main round hopes.</p><p><span class="umb-embed-holder" data-embed-constrain="true" data-embed-height="393" data-embed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-QScD87eqf0" data-embed-width="700"><iframe width="699" height="393" class="_iub_cs_activate" data-iub-purposes="3" data-suppressedsrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/-QScD87eqf0?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="HC Kriens-Luzern vs Industria Kielce | Highlights | EHF Champions League Men 2026/27"></iframe></span></p>
        </div>


<div class="consent-info js-consent-info" data-purposes="3">
    <div class="consent-info-content">
