<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Andy Schmid">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/2dtge1er/20261021_hckriensluzern-industriakielce_120.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/2dtge1er/20261021_hckriensluzern-industriakielce_120.jpg"
                         alt="20261021 Hckriensluzern Industriakielce 120">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
First, congratulations to Kielce. The Poles played smarter than we did, but we can still be proud of our EHF Champions League campaign. This was HC Kriens-Luzern&#39;s first participation, and I think we left our mark. A special thanks goes to our outstanding fans; they supported us fantastically until the end.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Andy Schmid</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach, HC Kriens-Luzern</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Krzysztof Lijewski">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/xb3klbb0/20261021_hckriensluzern-industriakielce_125.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/xb3klbb0/20261021_hckriensluzern-industriakielce_125.jpg"
                         alt="20261021 Hckriensluzern Industriakielce 125">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We’re happy about the win in this loud arena in Kriens. Sure, we had some tough moments, but we stuck to our game and are glad about these important two points.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Krzysztof Lijewski</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach, Industria Kielce</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

